- Lost Poems
- Ancient Records
- Recovered Artifacts
- Contradictions

---

The Dunes contain:

- Lost Cities
- Ancient Archives
- Original Histories
- Forgotten Civilizations
- Epoch Records

Purpose:

Preserve what civilization forgot.

